Cairn was forked from Project NOMAD v1.34.1 (commit f8e40fb).

Modifications from the upstream project include (and will continue to grow):
  - Renamed the project and its identifiers, install scripts, docs, and the
    in-app custom-instructions file from "Project NOMAD" / "NOMAD" to "Cairn".
  - Removed upstream marks: the logo (replaced with a placeholder), the
    projectnomad.us domain, the Discord invite, and the hosted benchmark
    leaderboard. Hosted-service URLs now point at the reserved "cairn.example"
    domain and are non-functional placeholders.
  - Removed references to upstream-owned container images
    (ghcr.io/crosstalk-solutions/*); the auto-updater and benchmark are inert
    until Cairn publishes its own images and backends.
  - Emptied the Creator Packs catalog (upstream-curated content).
  - Added this NOTICE file, an origin/credits section in README, a fork notice
    in admin/docs/about.md, and a second copyright line in LICENSE.

